You can set the file attributes on the file so that the standard
OpenVMS utilities like Mail, Diff, etc. can more easily handle these
files and still be able to use them from Excel. I create a symbol

FIXED*512 == "SET FILE/ATTRIBUTE=(RFM:FIX,RAT:NONE,ORG:SEQ,LRL:512)"

Then do $ fixed file.xls;
Bill



